message: "If you use this archive, please cite it as below, and cite the paper for the method."
title: "Reproducibility archive for 'CoxStream: Out-of-Core Cox Proportional Hazards Regression by Streaming Newton-Raphson'"
abstract: >-
  Benchmark harness, seeded data generator, result files and paper source for the CoxStream paper: every number in the paper regenerates from the result files, and the speed, memory and tie experiments can be rerun.
